==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Something that you can do would be to spawn [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Polevaulter Cat]] or any [[Long Distance]] unit, lure Lord Gravey towards the base and start spawning any stackable [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]]/[[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] that you have to keep the Gory Darks and Shadow Boxer K at bay and so on until you can kill Lord Gravey. [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Weightlifter Cat]] works quite well as an anti-Dark attacker.

